/* 步骤内联计时组件 · 拾味星球风格（单一连续布局：数字常驻原地跳动，无区块切换） */
.cook-timer {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-card);
  background: var(--accent-grad-soft, rgba(232, 100, 62, 0.10));
  border: 2rpx solid var(--accent-weak, rgba(232, 100, 62, 0.18));
  padding: 24rpx 28rpx;
}

/* ---- 常驻一行：时间 + 状态 + 主按钮 ---- */
.ct-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
  min-height: 76rpx;
}
.ct-time {
  font-size: 60rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--sub, #8B7F73);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  letter-spacing: 2rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  font-family: 'DIN Alternate', -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', monospace;
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.cook-timer.on .ct-time {
  color: var(--accent, #E8643E);
  text-shadow: 0 6rpx 20rpx var(--glow, rgba(240, 128, 90, 0.35));
}
.cook-timer.done .ct-time { color: var(--ok, #4E8A4E); text-shadow: none; }
.ct-time-hover { opacity: 0.65; }
.ct-add {
  margin-left: 10rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent, #E8643E);
  background: var(--card, #fff);
  border: 2rpx solid var(--accent-weak, rgba(232, 100, 62, 0.30));
  border-radius: 50%;
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  line-height: 1;
  align-self: center;
}

.ct-state {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  color: var(--sub, #8B7F73);
  background: var(--card, #fff);
  border-radius: var(--radius-tag);
  padding: 8rpx 20rpx;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.cook-timer.on .ct-state { color: var(--accent, #E8643E); font-weight: 600; }
.cook-timer.done .ct-state { color: var(--ok, #4E8A4E); background: var(--ok-weak, rgba(78, 138, 78, 0.12)); font-weight: 600; }

/* ---- 主按钮：常驻右侧，开始/暂停/继续/重置同一位置 ---- */
.t-btn {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  height: 68rpx;
  line-height: 68rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  border: none;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.t-btn::after { border: none; }
.t-btn.main {
  width: 152rpx;
  background: var(--accent-grad, linear-gradient(135deg, #F0805A, #E25A3C));
  color: var(--btn-text, #fff);
  box-shadow: 0 8rpx 20rpx var(--glow, rgba(240, 128, 90, 0.35));
  /* 原生 button 文字基线不齐，flex 强制双向居中 */
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  line-height: 1;
}
.cook-timer.done .t-btn.main {
  background: var(--fill, rgba(120, 100, 80, 0.10));
  color: var(--sub, #8B7F73);
  box-shadow: none;
}
.t-hover { opacity: 0.8; }

/* ---- 进度条：常驻空轨，开始后填充 ---- */
.progress-track {
  margin-top: 18rpx;
  height: 10rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--fill, rgba(120, 100, 80, 0.12));
  overflow: hidden;
}
.progress-bar {
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--accent-grad, linear-gradient(90deg, #F0805A, #E25A3C));
  transition: width 0.9s linear;
}
.cook-timer.done .progress-bar { background: var(--ok, #4E8A4E); }
